    <!-- 插件描述（Marketplace 与 IDE Plugins 页同源，支持基础 HTML；T-PluginDescReshape 结构定案）：
         ① 顶部英文摘要一行为预览卡首 40 字符硬约束而设（Marketplace 取描述前 40 字符做卡片文案，不可单独修改）；
         ② 中文内容整体位于英文正文之上（用户 2026-10-08 定案，参考件 MyBatisCodeHelperPro 同形）；
         ③ 不使用 <hr/> 与 HTML 注释——Marketplace 会剥离（实测：本地 tag 2026.10.7 含 hr，线上同版本描述 hr=0）；
         ④ 禁用 <img>（外链图 302 防盗链），截图走 Marketplace Media 区；
         ⑤ 数字类声明（11 方言 / 10 工具 / Alt+Shift+Q / 2024.3）由 PluginXmlStructureGuardTest 与代码对账。
         HTML 片段下同。 -->
    <description><![CDATA[
        <p><b>See the exact SQL your code will run.</b> Renders MyBatis-Plus, JPA and JdbcTemplate queries into executable SQL with real parameter values, before the server starts.</p>
        <p><b>服务未启，SQL 先知</b>——在 IntelliJ IDEA 内把 MyBatis-Plus、JPA、JdbcTemplate 查询还原为可执行 SQL，参数自动回填。</p>
        <p><a href="https://sql-visualizer.jvtools.cn">中文文档</a> · <a href="https://sql-visualizer.jvtools.cn/en/">English Docs</a> · <a href="https://sql-visualizer.jvtools.cn/about/feedback">需求池 / Feedback</a> · <a href="https://plugins.jetbrains.com/plugin/33633-sql-visualizer">Screenshots</a></p>

        <h3>中文</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><b>编码期预览 · SQL 来源全覆盖</b>：Lambda / Query / Update / Delete Wrapper 及服务链、MPJ 联表、mapper XML 动态标签（if / foreach / choose）、<code>@Select</code> 注解 SQL、Spring Data 派生查询、Specification / CriteriaQuery、HQL / <code>@Query</code>、JdbcTemplate / 自研 DAO 字符串 SQL、Querydsl / EasyQuery / Xbatis / MDS；Java Wrapper 完整预览，Kotlin Wrapper 当前可识别链路但无法可靠推断实体时会明确提示、不生成猜测 SQL；mapper XML、注解与 Wrapper 链内补全表名、列名与 <code>#{}</code> 参数</li>
            <li><b>真实参数一键回填</b>：<code>?</code> 替换为实际值（LIKE 自动拼百分号、按字段类型加引号），命名参数 <code>:name</code> 按名回填；OGNL 条件勾选；逻辑删除 / 乐观锁 / 多租户 / 数据权限按 MyBatis-Plus 拦截器语义还原；11 种数据库方言自动格式化</li>
            <li><b>运行期捕获（默认开启）</b>：向运行中的应用挂载轻量 agent 直接采集真实执行——不依赖日志格式，附目标库、毫秒级耗时、影响行数与执行报错；慢查询标红并给出静态性能建议，真实源码位置一键跳回、调用栈悬停弹层可逐帧跳转。控制台日志（MyBatis / Hibernate / JdbcTemplate 三族）作为不改工程的回落通道，按线程分桶、去重过滤、着色标记；保活刷屏一键屏蔽，历史 SQL 自动落盘</li>
            <li><b>生成与转换 · SQL 反向转 Java</b>：一键生成可直接编译的 QueryWrapper / LambdaQueryWrapper / Wrappers / MPJLambdaWrapper 代码（增删改查与多表 JOIN）</li>
            <li><b>CRUD SQL 一步直出</b>：实体类 / 数据库表右键生成 INSERT / UPDATE / SELECT / DELETE</li>
            <li><b>一键回滚 SQL</b>：对预览的 INSERT 推导逆向 DELETE（SQL Server / 达梦自增列自动包装）；UPDATE / DELETE 支持快照回填恢复</li>
            <li><b>执行与分析 · 执行 SQL 与执行计划</b>：内嵌原生 Database 控制台执行，一键 EXPLAIN 按方言提交，JOIN 关系图支持 PNG / SVG 导出；执行前有 <code>${}</code> 注入确认、无界写清单与超时护栏（需 Ultimate，社区版自动降级）</li>
            <li><b>调用栈悬停与最近执行记录</b>：调用栈悬停弹出调试器风格弹层（帧数可配置、跳转源码）；最近执行记录弹框浏览并跳转源码</li>
            <li><b>编码期与工作流增强</b>：mapper XML 语句语法高亮、动态标签折叠与引用导航、Mapper 接口方法与 XML 语句双向跳转；方言引号不匹配静态告警；SQL 快捷模板支持光标压在表名上使用；SQL 历史条目可钉住、正则检索、导出 CSV / TSV / 纯文本 / 可执行 SQL 脚本，并支持两条历史版本对比；预览参数预设按声明方法隔离并永久绑定、可折叠；分页拦截器模拟 LIMIT 与 COUNT 可分别控制；EXPLAIN 支持结构化渲染与 Oracle / SQL Server 模板</li>
            <li><b>面向 AI · MCP 工具</b>：接入平台 MCP Server（近版 IDE 内置），<code>sqlv_*</code> 11 个确定性只读工具覆盖渲染 / 日志还原 / 核查 / 执行计划 / 回滚预案 / CRUD / 反向转换等，设置页逐项门控</li>
        </ul>
        <p>触发方式：代码左侧 gutter 图标 / 右键菜单 / <code>Alt+Shift+Q</code>。</p>
        <p>要求：IntelliJ IDEA 2024.3 及之后全部版本（基线 2026.x）；执行 SQL、EXPLAIN 与原生 JOIN 图需 Ultimate；MCP 工具需平台 MCP Server。</p>

        <h3>English</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><b>Preview &middot; all SQL sources covered</b>: Wrapper chains (Lambda / Query / Update / Delete, service chains, MPJ joins), mapper XML dynamic tags (if / foreach / choose), <code>@Select</code> annotation SQL, Spring Data derived queries, Specification / CriteriaQuery, HQL / <code>@Query</code>, JdbcTemplate / custom-DAO string SQL, Querydsl / EasyQuery / Xbatis / MDS. Java Wrapper preview is fully supported; Kotlin Wrapper chains are recognized, but when entity metadata cannot be inferred reliably the plugin explains the limitation instead of generating guessed SQL. Completion covers table / column names and <code>#{}</code> parameters in mapper XML, annotations and Wrapper chains</li>
            <li><b>Real parameters</b>: <code>?</code> replaced with actual values (LIKE auto-wildcard, type-aware quoting), named parameters <code>:name</code>; OGNL condition checkboxes; logic-delete / optimistic-lock / multi-tenant / data-permission replay as MyBatis-Plus interceptors would; formatting for 11 database dialects</li>
            <li><b>Runtime capture (on by default)</b>: an agent attached to the running app collects every statement directly &mdash; no log format required, with target database, exact duration, affected rows and execution errors; slow queries are marked red with static performance advice, source locations come from the real call stack for one-click jump-back, and a call-stack popup navigates frame by frame. Console logs (MyBatis / Hibernate / JdbcTemplate) remain as the no-code-change fallback, bucketed by thread, de-duplicated and color-marked; one-click suppression for keep-alive noise; history archiving</li>
            <li><b>Generate &middot; SQL to Java</b>: convert any SQL back into compilable QueryWrapper / LambdaQueryWrapper / Wrappers / MPJLambdaWrapper code (CRUD and joins)</li>
            <li><b>CRUD SQL in one step</b>: right-click an entity class or database table to generate INSERT / UPDATE / SELECT / DELETE</li>
            <li><b>Rollback SQL in one click</b>: derive the reverse DELETE for an INSERT preview (identity-column wrapping for SQL Server and DM); snapshot recovery for UPDATE / DELETE</li>
            <li><b>Analyze &middot; execution and EXPLAIN</b>: run SQL in the embedded native Database console, one-click EXPLAIN, JOIN diagram with PNG / SVG export; <code>${}</code> injection confirmation, unbounded-write findings and a timeout guard (Ultimate; Community degrades gracefully)</li>
            <li><b>Call stack hover and recent executions</b>: debugger-style stack popup (configurable frame count, jump-to-source) and a recent-executions dialog</li>
            <li><b>Editing and workflow</b>: SQL syntax highlighting, dynamic-tag folding and reference navigation for mapper XML statements, plus two-way gutter jumps between mapper XML statements and interface methods; a static warning for dialect quote mismatches; SQL quick templates usable with the caret on a table name; history pinning, regex search, export to CSV / TSV / plain text / executable SQL, and two-entry version diff; collapsible parameter presets scoped to and permanently bound to the declaring method; pagination-interceptor simulation with LIMIT and COUNT controlled separately; structured EXPLAIN rendering plus Oracle / SQL Server templates</li>
            <li><b>AI agents &middot; MCP tools</b>: 11 deterministic read-only <code>sqlv_*</code> tools on the platform MCP Server (render, log restore, checks, EXPLAIN, rollback plan, CRUD, reverse SQL), per-tool gating in settings</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Trigger: gutter icon / context menu / <code>Alt+Shift+Q</code> (rebindable).</p>
        <p>Requirements: IntelliJ IDEA 2024.3+ (baseline 2026.x); Execute SQL, EXPLAIN and the native JOIN diagram need Ultimate; MCP tools need the platform MCP Server.</p>
        <h3>作者微信 / 交流群</h3>
        <p>两张二维码用途不同，请对照下方说明选择扫码（二维码为限时码）。</p>
